      [
       "medians",
       "Medians for country groups…",
       "Depending on your analytical needs, select the relevant medians for a group of economies: yearly medians are based on all the economies with data available in the particular year (columns E-V). To compare change over time, 2-, 4- and 5-year time series were computed based on a subset of economies for which data is available for the given period, to clean the effect of variation in data coverage (note that the number of economies with data available changes from year to year). Country groups were defined according to the 2025 classifications (UN M49, World Bank income groups 2025, ITU BDT regions, SIDS, LDCs, LLDCs)."
